d":8448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8732,"cost":{"input":0.000336,"output":0.001288,"cacheRead":0.0014784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0031024}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772544051218}}
{"type":"message","id":"d73f149f","parentId":"67a147bd","timestamp":"2026-03-03T13:20:55.590Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_S7bwz0eoVtwUxTb0wrNPXePU|fc_026f89829a8f948a0169a6e030119c81918327a70d07e4c41e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web page unit test books from detailed design Excel files, embedded images/OCR text, LWC/Apex source code, and a user-provided Excel template. Use when user asks to read design docs, extract field/API/check rules, parse code branches and data bindings, generate test cases, and fill a unit test book template (.xlsx).\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book Generator\n\nBuild and run a deterministic pipeline for unit test book generation.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Parse design Excel into `design_rules.json`.\n2. Parse LWC/Apex code into `code_rules.json`.\n3. Merge rules and generate markdown spec + normalized case JSON.\n4. Fill the user template workbook and export final test book.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Design workbook (`.xlsx`) with field definitions, API names, check notes, optional screenshots.\n- Code folder or zip with LWC/Apex files.\n- Unit test template workbook (`.xlsx`).\n\n## Commands\n\nRun from this skill directory.\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/parse_design_excel.py --input <design.xlsx> --out design_rules.json --ocr-lang jpn+eng\npython scripts/extract_code_rules.py --src <code_dir_or_zip> --out code_rules.json\npython scripts/generate_high_precision.py --design design_rules.json --code code_rules.json --out-md UnitTestSpec_HighPrecision.md --out-cases cases.json\npython scripts/export_to_excel.py --template <template.xlsx> --cases cases.json --out 単体試験書_WF001.xlsx\n```\n\nOr run one-shot:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir out\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- OCR is optional: install Tesseract and pass `--ocr-lang`.\n- If template headers are unknown, script performs best-effort column mapping by keyword.\n- Keep all output artifacts in one run directory for traceability.\n\n## Output Artifacts\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json`\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec_HighPrecision.md`\n- `単体試験書_*.xlsx`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772544055588}}
{"type":"message","id":"f01897f2","parentId":"d73f149f","timestamp":"2026-03-03T13:21:08.002Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Preparing concise Chinese reply**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_026f89829a8f948a0169a6e0311bc08191964906b062d61a67\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABppuAy_GXOGv4mBSFbJh9AMsxe_SDat1tm8VKE2MEE1niQxdhDL2XjwhalYS-FfHCRORvNik-2uKU3d59-kc_l7comC91IR8l-2XwOKSfrsRcKqnZ32de9V5ObJVue_ndhUa3KPLT5pybWDRoZjHxa4ikn5xJ0Zqi_lAUZW15MLj36HpHrB6rparqoYfIuja9O0GlVRqoq2T9aGDCG7gU3SQ5CtPjdDPV14zuOCdL9f6IGSru1Zh7wkaWeF3i4GRQTlfQfy4Q8EFuXZoHZaA6DTP2tUfoVPzm1IwO6Xfp27dMEWNZGbxZSf-z9iAbORZ6AyvZmFk0plqcrzhVfW5v3Ev8q9C37Ypt2qTqU-IkWiHrCFHhY79S2mJCr5GkqSvLJXgCceQkTCeqn_8xwGBvWHUnfywGO5p0Js48nCua8kX8R1OdKCHfbL4HHCdQ--sy6nQr_j1wV971CEr_2K2PN2xZ8eF1WqrJU3yBpPB_m8AyOFBfeHJw6tx-LzufttZeBBeay_FD4-3TtZ6mGJ1lcwQD1Q78f_0QW3fmb_CUSLZhrA1bRKGNL6J1zTeqOUkSHMWRnSSoy2QkOUcMhi4IiiXuEFZwBGfZl2Pp1IWMoAzVLrWI3aLV0eQLmuyA80sqhF2D1Iblndc3pBf9UnzWlcnut2r4KlywnJRocvZkih3TNoPhMj3wtLT_Il8Kia0L4l746q21hz5kpXZUl1qluRIxAWUhw7JXtiMVRoN2R5SnQMosL6RImG8drTW3hASNWwyb2PO9bnx35OJEY3D4J324zgZ_DBPShkz_k2TG7JmvvvN4sXlnQ5EALOX0Udp1uP0gJHE03Vl42-aHMgjN2vipeqUfSCxKnzo93NQnkZJPgWegfTplAkT23MDRFrQil8XbJgw_Klil0ASqG3xRby0K4LV_0HdWLj_8jEZ1DHvLqjK45RVJsKwz8ePfAZXNUAh6wgiQLxtNpoMqXBmut7N50iMrI1LnAQFsJpIAUsMiQYA9gtbOGZteDozxZQ1iEs7HU\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Preparing concise Chinese reply**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"READY\n\n可直接粘贴并填写下面模板（我将据此生成《单体测试书》初稿）：\n\n```markdown\n# 单体测试书输入模板（请尽量填写）\n\n## 1. 项目与模块信息\n- 项目名称：\n- 系统/子系统：\n- 模块名称：\n- 功能名称：\n- 需求编号/版本：\n- 文档版本/日期：\n- 相关人员（产品/开发/测试）：\n\n## 2. 背景与目标\n- 功能目标（这次要解决什么问题）：\n- 业务流程简述（1~5步）：\n- 成功标准（上线判定标准）：\n\n## 3. 范围说明\n### 3.1 测试范围（本次要测）\n- \n- \n\n### 3.2 不测范围（本次不测）\n- \n- \n\n## 4. 详细规则（尽量结构化）\n> 可按“页面/接口/批处理”分别描述\n\n### 4.1 页面/功能规则\n- 页面/功能点：\n- 输入项（字段名、类型、必填、长度、格式、默认值）：\n- 校验规则（前端/后端）：\n- 交互逻辑（按钮、状态切换、提示文案）：\n- 权限控制（角色可见/可编辑/可提交）：\n- 异常提示与错误码：\n\n### 4.2 接口规则（每个接口一段）\n- 接口名称：\n- URL/方法：\n- 请求参数（字段、类型、必填、约束）：\n- 返回字段（字段、类型、含义）：\n- 业务规则（成功/失败条件）：\n- 错误码与处理：\n- 幂等/重试/超时规则：\n\n### 4.3 数据与一致性规则\n- 涉及表/对象：\n- 写入/更新规则：\n- 事务要求：\n- 一致性要求（跨表/跨服务）：\n- 对账或补偿机制（如有）：\n\n## 5. 环境与依赖\n- 测试环境（dev/test/stg）：\n- 部署版本/分支：\n- 中间件依赖（DB/Redis/MQ/ES等）：\n- 外部系统依赖（第三方接口）：\n- 测试账号与角色：\n- 开关配置/参数（feature flag）：\n\n## 6. 输入资料清单\n- 需求文档：\n- 接口文档：\n- 设计稿/原型：\n- 数据库设计：\n- 代码仓库/分支：\n- 历史缺陷或回归清单：\n\n## 7. 重点关注（可选）\n- 高风险点：\n- 历史易错点：\n- 本次必须覆盖场景：\n\n## 8. 计划信息（可选）\n- 提测时间：\n- 测试开始/结束时间：\n- 上线时间：\n```\n\n如果你现在资料不全，也可以先发已有内容；我会先给你“最小补充清单 + 可用草稿版”。","textSignature":"msg_026f89829a8f948a0169a6e0323798819181350c0c415683c1"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":622,"output":722,"cacheRead":8576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9920,"cost":{"input":0.0010885,"output":0.010108,"cacheRead":0.0015007999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012697300000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772544055591}}
